    "abilities": {
      "P": {
        "slot": "P",
        "id": "GnarPassive",
        "name": "狂怒基因",
        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "在战斗时，纳尔会产生怒气。在怒气到达最大值时，他的下一个技能将使他变形成巨型纳尔，获得强化的生存能力并能使用新的技能。",
        "bodyHtml": "纳尔可通过造成和受到伤害来生成<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">怒气</span>。在满层<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">怒气</span>时，他的下一个技能会使他变形为<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">巨型纳尔</span>，持续15秒。<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">小型纳尔：</span>获得<span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">移动速度</span>，<span>(5.5% ~ 99%)攻击速度</span>，以及(0 ~ 100)攻击距离。<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">巨型纳尔：</span>获得<span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">最大生命值</span>，<span class=\"text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400\">(3.5 ~ 54.5)护甲</span>，<span>(3.5 ~ 63)魔法抗性</span>，和<span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(6 ~ 48.5)攻击力</span>。",
        "iconFile": "Gnar_Passive.png",
        "cooldownSeconds": [],
        "range": [],
        "rankValues": [],
        "scalings": [],
